  "problem": "Which of the following is equivalent to ${\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r,$ where $F(x,y)=(x+y)^{2}\\,i+{e}^{x-y}\\,j$ and $C$ is the line segment traversed from the point $A(-2,1)$ to the point $B(1,-1)?$\n\n*Hint: Use the parametrization $r(t)=(-2+3t)\\,i+(1-2t)\\,j.$*",
